  "prefLabel": "Odb 203.07 Identification of Communications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 203.07 Identification of Communications. Communications shall contain the name and address of the communicator and the subject of the communication. When the subject matter pertains to a pending proceeding, the title of the proceeding shall be given.\n\nSource. #8490-A, eff 11-22-05; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/odb100-600.html"
